Rushing the work,

287
00:14:28,400 --> 00:14:29,930
and rushing to take orders.

288
00:14:30,040 --> 00:14:31,120
When people rush,

289
00:14:31,680 --> 00:14:33,120
accidents happen easily.

290
00:14:33,120 --> 00:14:34,250
You know quite a lot.

291
00:14:35,680 --> 00:14:36,880
What else do you know?

292
00:14:36,960 --> 00:14:38,560
Your temper isn't like your dad's.

293
00:14:38,560 --> 00:14:39,760
It's like your mom's.

294
00:14:40,520 --> 00:14:41,240
Zhao Long.

295
00:14:41,920 --> 00:14:43,580
You shouldn't have come back.

296
00:14:43,960 --> 00:14:45,640
I come and go as I please.

297
00:14:46,200 --> 00:14:46,880
What?

298
00:14:47,800 --> 00:14:49,520
Are you afraid of me coming back?

299
00:14:49,520 --> 00:14:50,040
Afraid.

300
00:14:51,400 --> 00:14:52,060
I am afraid.

301
00:14:54,040 --> 00:14:55,200
I'm just afraid...

302
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:01,080
Uncle San!

303
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:05,040
Stop!

304
00:15:12,360 --> 00:15:13,240
Xiaolong!

305
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:16,130
Brother! Xiaolong!

306
00:15:45,320 --> 00:15:46,160
Liu Guang.

307
00:15:48,400 --> 00:15:49,860
I'm asking you for a favor.

308
00:15:50,440 --> 00:15:51,720
I found Xiaohu.

309
00:15:53,080 --> 00:15:54,810
Have your car wait for two days.

310
00:15:57,880 --> 00:16:00,440
I don't care about what happened between you and Liu Ming back then.

311
00:16:00,440 --> 00:16:01,080
The wood

312
00:16:01,320 --> 00:16:02,080
and the money,

313
00:16:02,080 --> 00:16:03,140
they're all yours.

314
00:16:04,800 --> 00:16:05,840
Just do me a favor

315
00:16:06,320 --> 00:16:07,320
and wait two days.

316
00:16:09,160 --> 00:16:11,160
Take Xiaohu with you when you leave.

317
00:16:12,720 --> 00:16:13,440
Liu Guang.

318
00:16:14,920 --> 00:16:16,250
Are you listening to me?

319
00:16:35,960 --> 00:16:36,880
He ran away.
